, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.'=>'Events Manager can copy your events, venues, organisers, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.','Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s'=>'Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s','Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.'=>'Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.','Events Manager for WooCommerce'=>'Events Manager for WooCommerce','Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organizers, tickets and attendees.'=>'Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organisers, tickets and attendees.','Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.'=>'Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.','Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.'=>'Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.','Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.'=>'Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.','Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.','Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.'=>'Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.' . "\0" . 'Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as a list of %2$d dates.','Events Manager has no rule for %s.'=>'Events Manager has no rule for %s.','Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.'=>'Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.','Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!'=>'Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!','Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.'=>'Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.','Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.'=>'Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.','Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.'=>'Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.','Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.'=>'Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.','Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.','Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.'=>'Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.','Events Types (Archetypes)'=>'Events Types (Archetypes)','Events With Bookings Enabled'=>'Events With Bookings Enabled','Events can choose their own?'=>'Events can choose their own?','Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.'=>'Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.','Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.'=>'Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.','Events cannot start after they end.'=>'Events cannot start after 