entity-decoded shortcode content will be sanitised after being decoded, we STRONGLY recommend leaving this enabled.','HTML is not accepted.'=>'HTML is not accepted.','Headings'=>'Headings','Help'=>'Help','Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.'=>'Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.','Hidden Links'=>'Hidden Links','Hidden by default?'=>'Hidden by default?','Hidden from listings (yes or no)'=>'Hidden from listings (yes or no)','Hidden from upcoming'=>'Hidden from upcoming','Hidden link text'=>'Hidden link text','Hidden links'=>'Hidden links','Hide'=>'Hide','Hide Advanced Options'=>'Hide Advanced Options','Hide Advanced Search'=>'Hide Advanced Search','Hide Search'=>'Hide Search','Hide form until tickets selected?'=>'Hide form until tickets selected?','Hide label'=>'Hide label','Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts'=>'Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts','Hide on %s screen size?'=>'Hide on %s screen size?','Hold spaces while booking?'=>'Hold spaces while booking?','Hold time'=>'Hold time','Holds'=>'Holds','Host account'=>'Host account','Hosted by %s'=>'Hosted by %s','Hours'=>'Hours','How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.'=>'How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.','How long before an event can users cancel?'=>'How long before an event can users cancel?','How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.'=>'How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.','How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.'=>'How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.','How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.'=>'How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.','However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.'=>'However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.','Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.'=>'Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.','Hybrid'=>'Hybrid','Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)','Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)'=>'Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)','I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.'=>'I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.','I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.'=>'I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.','I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).'=>'I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).','ID'=>'ID','IP: %s'=>'IP: %s','Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.'=>'Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.','If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.'=>'If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.','If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.'=>'If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.','If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.'=>'If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.','If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.'=>'If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.','If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).'=>'If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).','If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?'=>'If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?','If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.'=>'If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.','If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.'=>'If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.','If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.'=>'If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.','If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.'=>'If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.','If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder'=>'If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder','If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.'=>'If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.'=>'If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.','If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.'=>'If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.','If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s'=>'If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s','If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.'=>'If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.','If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.'=>'If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.','If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.'=>'If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.','If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.'=>'If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.','If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.'=>'If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.','If enabled, users can book an event more than once.'=>'If enabled, users can book an event more than once.','If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.'=>'If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.','If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.'=>'If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.','If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.'=>'If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.','If left blank, no emails will be sent. Separate emails with commas for more than one email.'=>'If left blank, no emails will be sent. Seperate emails with commas for more than one email.','If left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'If left blank, the default value will be used.','If left blank, this email will not be sent.'=>'If left blank, this email will not be sent.','If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.'=>'If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.'=>'If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.'=>'If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.','If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.','If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.','If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.'=>'If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.','If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.'=>'If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.','If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.'=>'If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.','If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.'=>'If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.','If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.'=>'If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.','If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.'=>'If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.','If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.'=>'If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.','If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.'=>'If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.','If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.'=>'If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.','If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.'=>'If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.','If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.'=>'If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.','If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.'=>'If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.','If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.'=>'If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.','If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.'=>'If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.','If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.'=>'If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.','If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.','If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>'=>'If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>','If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.'=>'If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.','If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.'=>'If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.','If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.'=>'If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.','If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.'=>'If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.','If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.'=>'If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.','If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.'=>'If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.','If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.'=>'If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.','If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.'=>'If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.','If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.'=>'If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.','If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.'=>'If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.','If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.'=>'If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.','If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.'=>'If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.','If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.'=>'If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.','If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.'=>'If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.','If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.'=>'If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.','If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.'=>'If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.','If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.'=>'If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.','If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.'=>'If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.','If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.'=>'If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.','If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.'=>'If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.','If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.'=>'If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.','If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.'=>'If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.','If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.'=>'If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.','If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).'=>'If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).','If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.'=>'If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.','If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.'=>'If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.','If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.'=>'If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.','If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.'=>'If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.','If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.'=>'If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.','If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.'=>'If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.','Image'=>'Image','Image Dimensions'=>'Image Dimensions','Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.'=>'Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.','Import'=>'Import','Import %1$s, %2$s'=>'Import %1$s, %2$s','Import Settings'=>'Import Settings','Import a %s'=>'Import a %s','Import and Migrate'=>'Import and Migrate','Import as'=>'Import as','Import as a list of dates'=>'Import as a list of dates','Import events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.'=>'Import events, locations or organisers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organisers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.','Import into Events Manager'=>'Import into Events Manager','Import/Export Settings'=>'Import/Export Settings','Imported, with a note'=>'Imported, with a note','Importing rows'=>'Importing rows','Imports'=>'Imports','Imports events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, one row for each. A repeating event is