anager','Uninstall and Deactivate'=>'Uninstall and Deactivate','Uninstall/Reset'=>'Uninstall/Reset','Unknown migration source.'=>'Unknown migration source.','Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.'=>'Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.','Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.'=>'Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.','Unrecognized file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.'=>'Unrecognised file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.','Unrecognized image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.'=>'Unrecognised image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.','Up to %d%% off'=>'Up to %d%% off','Upcoming'=>'Upcoming','Upcoming %s'=>'Upcoming %s','Upcoming Events'=>'Upcoming Events','Upcoming timeslot limit'=>'Upcoming timeslot limit','Update %s'=>'Update %s','Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.'=>'Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.','Update Blogs'=>'Update Blogs','Update Event Category'=>'Update Event Category','Update Event Tag'=>'Update Event Tag','Update Network'=>'Update Network','Update booking'=>'Update booking','Update event'=>'Update event','Update location'=>'Update location','Update preview'=>'Update preview','Update process has finished.'=>'Update process has finished.','Update ticket'=>'Update ticket','Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.'=>'Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.','Updated'=>'Updated','Updates an Events Manager %s.'=>'Updates an Events Manager %s.','Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.'=>'Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.','Updates an Events Manager event.'=>'Updates an Events Manager event.','Updates an Events Manager location.'=>'Updates an Events Manager location.','Updates an Events Manager ticket.'=>'Updates an Events Manager ticket.','Updates and support until %s'=>'Updates and support until %s','Upgrade to %s'=>'Upgrade to %s','Upgrade to %s for more options!'=>'Upgrade to %s for more options!','Upload Limits'=>'Upload Limits','Upload a file'=>'Upload a file','Upload a file first.'=>'Upload a file first.','Upload and match columns'=>'Upload and match columns','Upload media'=>'Upload media','Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your licence from its settings.','Upload/change picture'=>'Upload/change picture','Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s'=>'Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s','Uploads'=>'Uploads','Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)'=>'Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)','Use 24h Format?'=>'Use 24h Format?','Use Defaults'=>'Use Defaults','Use SMTP authentication?'=>'Use SMTP authentication?','Use Visual Editor?'=>'Use Visual Editor?','Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.'=>'Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.','Use dropdown for locations?'=>'Use dropdown for locations?','Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.'=>'Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.','Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).'=>'Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).','Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.'=>'Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.','Used if an excerpt has been defined.'=>'Used if an excerpt has been defined.','Used if an excerpt has not been defined.'=>'Used if an excerpt has not been defined.','Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.'=>'Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.','Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.'=>'Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.','User Capabilities'=>'User Capabilities','User Fields'=>'User Fields','User can book'=>'User can book','User can create and edit %s'=>'User can create and edit %s','User can delete %s categories and tags.'=>'User can delete %s categories and tags.','User can delete other users %s'=>'User can delete other users %s','User can delete their own %s'=>'User can delete their own %s','User can edit %s categories and tags.'=>'User can edit %s categories and tags.','User can edit other users %s'=>'User can edit other users %s','User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.'=>'User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.','User can upload images along with their events and locations.'=>'User can upload images along with their events and locations.','User can use and manage bookings with their events.'=>'User can use and manage bookings with their events.','User can use other user locations for their events.'=>'User can use other user locations for their events.','User can view private %s'=>'User can view private %s','User must log in'=>'User must log in','Username'=>'Username','Username: %s'=>'Username: %s','Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.'=>'Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.','Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.'=>'Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.','Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval'=>'Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval','Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.'=>'Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.','Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.'=>'Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.','Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.'=>'Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.','Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.'=>'Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.','Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.'=>'Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.','Value'=>'Value','Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.','Venues'=>'Venues','View'=>'View','View %s'=>'View %s','View As'=>'View As','View Bookings'=>'View Bookings','View Event'=>'View Event','View Event Bookings'=>'View Event Bookings','View Location'=>'View Location','View Range'=>'View Range','View Timeslot'=>'View Timeslot','View Types'=>'View Types','View all posts in %s'=>'View all posts in %s','View event details'=>'View event details','View license'=>'View licence','View/Edit Event