ry associated with any event in this recurrence. To keep booking information, go to the relevant single event and save it to detach it from this recurrence series.','WARNING: This action cannot be undone.'=>'WARNING: This action cannot be undone.','WARNING: This is a %s.'=>'WARNING: This is a %s.','WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.'=>'WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.','WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.'=>'WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.','WP FullCalendar'=>'WP FullCalendar','WPML Compatibility'=>'WPML Compatibility','Waiting to sync with the provider.'=>'Waiting to sync with the provider.','Waitlist'=>'Waitlist','Waitlist Approved'=>'Waitlist Approved','Waitlist Expired'=>'Waitlist Expired','Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.'=>'Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.','Warning!'=>'Warning!','Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?','Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.'=>'Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.','We are going to use %s for searching.'=>'We are going to use %s for searching.','We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.'=>'We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.','We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.'=>'We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.','We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.'=>'We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.','We could not find any active bookings for your email address.'=>'We could not find any active bookings for your email address.','We could not verify that booking. Please start again.'=>'We could not verify that booking. Please start again.','We impose some theme styling rules which help normalize the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.'=>'We impose some theme styling rules which help normalise the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.','We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.'=>'We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.','We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.'=>'We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.','We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.'=>'We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.','We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalized, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.'=>'We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalised, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.','We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP'=>'We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP','We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!'=>'We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!','We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.'=>'We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.','We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser timezone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.'=>'We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser time zone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.','We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!'=>'We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!','Website'=>'Website','Week %d'=>'Week %d','Weekly'=>'Weekly','Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.'=>'Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.','What the file holds'=>'What the file holds','When'=>'When','When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behavior is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.'=>'When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behaviour is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.','When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.'=>'When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.','When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.'=>'When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.','When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customized below.'=>'When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customised below.','When a booking is registered and confirmed.'=>'When a booking is registered and confirmed.','When a booking is registered but pending.'=>'When a booking is registered but pending.','When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.'=>'When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.','When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.'=>'When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.','When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.'=>'When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.','When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.'=>'When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.','When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be published until you re-approve it.'=>'When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be publisehd until you re-approve it.','When a user must log in before making a booking.'=>'When a user must log in before making a booking.','When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.'=>'When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.','When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.'=>'When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.','When creating a new event, this timezone will be applied by default.'=>'When creating a new event, this time zone will be applied by default.','When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?'=>'When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?','When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.'=>'When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.','When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.'=>'When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.','When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?'=>'When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?','When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.'=>'When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.','When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.'=>'When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.','When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.'=>'When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.','When listing categories, this order is applied.'=>'When listing categories, this order is applied.','When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.'=>'When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.','When listing tags, this order is applied.'=>'When listing tags, this order is applied.','When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.'=>'When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.','When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.'=>'When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.','When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.'=>'When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.','When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.'=>'When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.'=>'When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.','When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.'=>'When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.','When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?'=>'When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?','Where'=>'Where','Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.'=>'Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.','Why'=>'Why','Will be imported'=>'Will be imported','Will be skipped'=>'Will be skipped','With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.'=>'With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.','Withdrawal page'=>'Withdrawal page','Withdrawal period (days)'=>'Withdrawal period (days)','Withdrawal policy / instructions'=>'Withdrawal policy / instructions','Withdrawal received for booking #%d'=>'Withdrawal received for booking #%d','Within'=>'Within','Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.'=>'Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.','WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com'=>'WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com','WooCommerce ticket orders become'=>'WooCommerce ti